\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_event r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                           WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decl_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decl_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RELEASE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                              AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> open_committed_amt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">period_to</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">guarantee_to</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PERIOD_GAP_RISK'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">guarantee_to</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RENEWAL_URGENT'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'OK'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> risk_flag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> duty_insurance_policy p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACTIVE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FILED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> days_to_guarantee_end;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>PERIOD_GAP_RISK</code> 是这份查询的核心产出：当保险期间比担保期限更早到期时，系统提前暴露这个缺口，而不是等到保单失效才发现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>保单比保函多一道核保关口，获批时间不可控且拒保是常规结果，必须有自动转其他担保工具的降级路径。</li>\n<li>保单有&quot;保险期间&quot;与&quot;担保期限&quot;两条时间轴，必须用约束或强校验保证前者覆盖后者，错配分前段缺口、后段缺口、分段不连续三种形态，处置原则是重叠而非拼接。</li>\n<li>批改不换发保单，保单主体不变；<code>requires_customs_refiling</code> 必须驱动海关重新备案的待办，否则加保后用不上额度。</li>\n<li>减保前置条件与保函减额一致：关联额度池零未结占用。</li>\n<li>理赔由海关索赔与企业举证两条线并行推进；系统最有价值的能力是预防拒赔，重点是证据留存与保额规模比对。</li>\n<li>退保除零未结占用外还需已发生保险责任结清；失效是保单特有的终止形态，保费缴纳提醒应与到期提醒同级。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一步：担保的全成本与资金优化，见 <a href=\"../guarantee-ops-optimize/guarantee-cost-cash-optimize\">担保成本与现金占用优化</a>；理赔与拒赔风险如何纳入监控，见 <a href=\"../guarantee-ops-optimize/guarantee-risk-monitor\">担保风险与额度预警</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"关税保证保险保单生命周期","id":"关税保证保险保单生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"投保与核保：保单比保函多一道关口","id":"投保与核保-保单比保函多一道关口"},{"level":3,"text":"保单要素与保函要素的差异","id":"保单要素与保函要素的差异"},{"level":2,"text":"保险期间与担保期限的不重合","id":"保险期间与担保期限的不重合"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么用 CHECK 约束而不是靠人工核对","id":"为什么用-check-约束而不是靠人工核对"},{"level":3,"text":"期间错配的三种典型形态","id":"期间错配的三种典型形态"},{"level":2,"text":"批改：加保、减保与信息变更","id":"批改-加保-减保与信息变更"},{"level":3,"text":"减保的前置条件与保函一致","id":"减保的前置条件与保函一致"},{"level":2,"text":"报案与理赔：与海关索赔的衔接","id":"报案与理赔-与海关索赔的衔接"},{"level":3,"text":"核赔拒付的常见原因与系统预防","id":"核赔拒付的常见原因与系统预防"},{"level":2,"text":"退保与保单终止","id":"退保与保单终止"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"海关索赔与垫付处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-tax-guarantee-bond-insurance/bond-lifecycle-claim/customs-claim-payout"},"next":{"title":"担保成本与现金占用优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-tax-guarantee-bond-insurance/guarantee-ops-optimize/guarantee-cost-cash-optimize"}}